[% USE raw %]
[% USE Koha %]
[% PROCESS 'i18n.inc' %]
[% SET footerjs = 1 %]
[% INCLUDE 'doc-head-open.inc' %]
<title>Koha: Book Display Impact</title>
[% INCLUDE 'doc-head-close.inc' %]
<style>
.impact-hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#17324d,#245b64 70%,#2d7372);color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:25px 29px;margin-bottom:20px;box-shadow:0 5px 18px rgba(23,50,77,.2)}
.impact-hero h1{color:#fff;font-family:Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 7px}.impact-hero p{color:#dcebed;font-size:1.08rem;margin:0}.impact-kicker{color:#e2c675;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700;font-size:.78rem}
.impact-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9e2e6;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;box-shadow:0 2px 9px rgba(23,50,77,.07);border-top:4px solid #2d7372}.impact-card.gold{border-top-color:#b28b32}.impact-card.blue{border-top-color:#3d6685}.impact-value{font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#17324d;font-size:2rem}.impact-label{color:#5a707a;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.76rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em}
.priority{display:inline-block;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:700}.priority-High{background:#f8d7da;color:#842029}.priority-Review{background:#fff3cd;color:#664d03}.priority-Monitor{background:#e2e3e5;color:#41464b}.evidence-Strong{color:#176b62;font-weight:700}.evidence-Moderate{color:#8a681d;font-weight:700}.evidence-Limited{color:#6c757d}
.impact-panel{border:1px solid #d9e2e6;border-radius:8px}.impact-panel>.panel-heading{background:#f1f5f6;color:#17324d;padding:13px 16px}.impact-panel th{background:#f8fafb;color:#294d5b;white-space:nowrap}.decision-box{min-width:245px}.decision-box input[type=number]{width:62px;display:inline-block}.decision-box textarea{width:100%;height:48px;margin:5px 0}.method-note{border-left:4px solid #b28b32;background:#fffdf7;padding:12px 15px;margin:15px 0}
</style>
</head>
<body>
[% INCLUDE 'header.inc' %]
[% INCLUDE 'cat-search.inc' %]
[% WRAPPER 'sub-header.inc' %]
 [% WRAPPER breadcrumbs %]
  [% WRAPPER breadcrumb_item %]<a href="/cgi-bin/koha/plugins/plugins-home.pl">Plugins</a>[% END %]
  [% WRAPPER breadcrumb_item %]<a href="?class=[% CLASS %]&method=[% METHOD %]">Promotion &amp; Engagement</a>[% END %]
  [% WRAPPER breadcrumb_item bc_active=1 %]<span>Book Display Impact</span>[% END %]
 [% END %]
[% END %]
<div class="container-fluid"><div class="row">
<div class="col-sm-10 col-sm-push-2"><main>
 <div class="impact-hero">
  <div class="impact-kicker">Evidence to collection action</div>
  <h1>Book Display Impact</h1>
  <p>Find displayed books with sustained borrowing and hold pressure, review the evidence, and send approved additional-copy requests to Koha Suggestions.</p>
 </div>
 [% IF success_message %]<div class="alert alert-success">[% success_message | html %]</div>[% END %]
 [% IF error_message %]<div class="alert alert-danger">[% error_message | html %]</div>[% END %]
 <div class="panel panel-default impact-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><strong>Select a campaign</strong></div>
  <div class="panel-body">
   <form method="get">
    <input type="hidden" name="class" value="[% CLASS %]"><input type="hidden" name="method" value="[% METHOD %]">
    <input type="hidden" name="action" value="book_display_impact">
    <label for="campaign_id">Campaign</label>
    <select id="campaign_id" name="campaign_id" class="form-control" style="max-width:620px;display:inline-block">
     [% FOREACH campaign IN campaigns %]
      <option value="[% campaign.campaign_id %]"[% IF selected_id == campaign.campaign_id %] selected[% END %]>[% campaign.name | html %] ([% campaign.start_date | html %])</option>
     [% END %]
    </select>
    <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit"><i class="fa fa-refresh"></i> Calculate impact</button>
   </form>
  </div>
 </div>
 [% IF impact %]
 <div class="row">
  <div class="col-md-3"><div class="impact-card"><div class="impact-label">Displayed titles</div><div class="impact-value">[% impact.summary.title_count %]</div></div></div>
  <div class="col-md-3"><div class="impact-card gold"><div class="impact-label">High priority</div><div class="impact-value">[% impact.summary.high_priority_count %]</div></div></div>
  <div class="col-md-2"><div class="impact-card blue"><div class="impact-label">Active holds</div><div class="impact-value">[% impact.summary.active_holds %]</div></div></div>
  <div class="col-md-2"><div class="impact-card"><div class="impact-label">Approved</div><div class="impact-value">[% impact.summary.approved_count %]</div></div></div>
  <div class="col-md-2"><div class="impact-card gold"><div class="impact-label">Sent to Koha</div><div class="impact-value">[% impact.summary.submitted_count %]</div></div></div>
 </div>
 <div class="method-note"><strong>How recommendations work:</strong> circulation response and active holds are evidence, not automatic purchasing authority. The suggested quantity follows Koha's configured hold-ratio target per serviceable copy. A librarian must approve every request before Koha Suggestions receives it.</div>
 <div class="panel panel-default impact-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><strong>Displayed-title demand and additional-copy review</strong></div><div class="panel-body">
 [% IF impact.rows.size %]<div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-striped table-hover">
 <thead><tr><th>Displayed book</th><th>Response</th><th>Copies</th><th>Demand</th><th>Evidence</th><th>Recommendation</th><th>Decision</th></tr></thead>
 <tbody>[% FOREACH item IN impact.rows %]<tr>
  <td><strong><a href="/cgi-bin/koha/catalogue/detail.pl?biblionumber=[% item.biblionumber %]">[% item.title | html %]</a></strong>[% IF item.author %]<br><span class="text-muted">[% item.author | html %]</span>[% END %]<br><small>Displayed barcode(s): [% item.barcodes.join(', ') | html %]</small></td>
  <td>Before: <strong>[% item.baseline_count %]</strong><br>During: <strong>[% item.during_count %]</strong><br>After 60 days: <strong>[% item.after_60_count %]</strong></td>
  <td>Total: [% item.total_copies %]<br>Serviceable: [% item.serviceable_copies %]<br>Available now: [% item.available_copies %]</td>
  <td>Active holds: <strong>[% item.active_holds %]</strong><br>Holds/copy: [% item.hold_ratio %]</td>
  <td><span class="priority priority-[% item.priority %]">[% item.priority %]</span><br><span class="evidence-[% item.evidence_grade %]">[% item.evidence_grade %] evidence</span></td>
  <td>[% IF item.purchase_signal %]<strong>Consider [% item.suggested_quantity %] additional cop[% IF item.suggested_quantity == 1 %]y[% ELSE %]ies[% END %]</strong>[% ELSE %]<strong>Monitor; no purchase signal yet</strong>[% END %]<br><small>[% item.recommendation_reason | html %]</small></td>
  <td class="decision-box">
   [% IF item.decision && item.decision.decision_status == 'submitted' %]
    <span class="label label-success">Sent to Koha</span><br>Suggestion #[% item.decision.koha_suggestion_id %]<br>
    <a href="/cgi-bin/koha/suggestion/suggestion.pl?suggestionid=[% item.decision.koha_suggestion_id %]&op=edit_form">Open Koha suggestion</a>
   [% ELSE %]
    <form method="post" action="/cgi-bin/koha/plugins/run.pl">
     <input type="hidden" name="class" value="[% CLASS | html %]"><input type="hidden" name="method" value="[% METHOD | html %]">
     <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="[% Koha.GenerateCSRF | html %]">
     <input type="hidden" name="op" value="cud-save_impact_decision"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="book_display_impact">
     <input type="hidden" name="campaign_id" value="[% selected_id %]"><input type="hidden" name="biblionumber" value="[% item.biblionumber %]">
     <label>Quantity <input class="form-control input-sm" type="number" name="recommended_quantity" min="1" max="99" value="[% IF item.decision %][% item.decision.recommended_quantity %][% ELSE %][% item.suggested_quantity %][% END %]"></label>
     <textarea class="form-control input-sm" name="reviewer_note" placeholder="Optional review note">[% IF item.decision %][% item.decision.reviewer_note | html %][% END %]</textarea>
     <button class="btn btn-xs btn-success" name="decision_status" value="approved"><i class="fa fa-check"></i> Approve</button>
     <button class="btn btn-xs btn-default" name="decision_status" value="rejected"><i class="fa fa-times"></i> Reject</button>
    </form>
    [% IF item.decision && item.decision.decision_status == 'approved' %]
    <form method="post" action="/cgi-bin/koha/plugins/run.pl" style="margin-top:7px">
     <input type="hidden" name="class" value="[% CLASS | html %]"><input type="hidden" name="method" value="[% METHOD | html %]">
     <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="[% Koha.GenerateCSRF | html %]"><input type="hidden" name="op" value="cud-submit_impact_suggestion">
     <input type="hidden" name="action" value="book_display_impact"><input type="hidden" name="campaign_id" value="[% selected_id %]"><input type="hidden" name="biblionumber" value="[% item.biblionumber %]">
     <button class="btn btn-xs btn-primary"><i class="fa fa-share"></i> Send to Koha Suggestions</button>
    </form>
    [% END %]
   [% END %]
  </td>
 </tr>[% END %]</tbody></table></div>
 [% ELSE %]<div class="alert alert-info">This campaign has no linked Koha books to assess.</div>[% END %]
 </div></div>
 <div class="alert alert-info"><strong>Responsible interpretation:</strong> checkout and hold data indicate demand and access pressure. They do not by themselves prove that the physical display caused every loan, and they do not replace professional collection-development judgment.</div>
 [% END %]
</main></div>
<div class="col-sm-2 col-sm-pull-10"><aside><div class="sidebar_menu"><ul>
 <li><a href="?class=[% CLASS %]&method=[% METHOD %]">Dashboard</a></li>
 <li><a href="?class=[% CLASS %]&method=[% METHOD %]&action=new_promotion">New promotion</a></li>
 <li><a href="?class=[% CLASS %]&method=[% METHOD %]&action=promotions">Promotions</a></li>
 <li><a href="?class=[% CLASS %]&method=[% METHOD %]&action=analytics">Analytics</a></li>
 <li class="active"><a href="?class=[% CLASS %]&method=[% METHOD %]&action=book_display_impact">Book Display Impact</a></li>
 <li><a href="?class=[% CLASS %]&method=[% METHOD %]&action=reports">Reports</a></li>
</ul></div></aside></div>
</div></div>
[% INCLUDE 'intranet-bottom.inc' %]
